WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.243
Your day deserves more than a forgotten note. Meet Wispr Diary.

2
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.000
Make a book of your own. Give it a title, choose a cover, and make a little space for

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.489
your day.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.711
A short welcome shows you where everything lives. Skip it anytime, or come back to the

5
00:00:16.711 --> 00:00:18.308
tour from the Book menu.

6
00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:24.642
Tell the story of your day, or type it. Your words belong on the page, with more room

7
00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:25.800
whenever you need it.

8
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:31.871
Diary, add note: remember the little things. Keep a thought on a sticky note, and move

9
00:00:31.871 --> 00:00:33.414
it around by its grip.

10
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:39.926
Bring the day back with a photograph, a video, or a voice recording. Keep each memory

11
00:00:39.926 --> 00:00:41.279
right beside your words.

12
00:00:42.392 --> 00:00:47.488
Choose lined or blank paper, and a page color you love. Contents brings you back to

13
00:00:47.488 --> 00:00:49.081
any part of your story.

14
00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:55.003
Your books stay in your account. Save unfinished thoughts in Ideas for Later, until

15
00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:56.381
they find their page.

16
00:00:57.517 --> 00:01:00.302
Wispr Diary. Less typing. More living.
